</h3>

</a>

    <div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id2682279" data-element-type="problems-exercises" class="os-hasSolution"><header></header><section><div data-type="problem" id="fs-id2682280">
<a class="os-number" href="chapter-13" aria-label="Go to 22" data-page-slug="chapter-13" data-page-uuid="f74fb514-9100-58e8-aa11-9a3474e521fb" data-page-fragment="fs-id2682279-solution">22</a><span class="os-divider">. </span>
<div class="os-problem-container"><p id="import-auto-id2236470">The gauge pressure in your car tires is <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mtext>50</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mtext>10</mtext><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup><mtext> N/m</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mtext>50</mtext><mo>×</mo><msup><mtext>10</mtext><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup><mtext> N/m</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{2 "." "50"´"10" rSup { size 8{5} } " N/m" rSup { size 8{2} } } {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> at a temperature of <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>35</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>35</mtext><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{"35" "." 0°C} {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> when you drive it onto a ferry boat to Alaska. What is their gauge pressure later, when their temperature has dropped to <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">–</mo><mtext>40</mtext></mrow><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">–</mo><mtext>40</mtext></mrow><mtext>.</mtext><mn>0</mn><mtext>º</mtext><mtext>C</mtext></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{ +- "40" "." 0°C} {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span>?</p></div>
</div>

