    <div data-type="exercise" id="fs-id2798567" data-element-type="problems-exercises"><header></header><section><div data-type="problem" id="fs-id2798568">
<span class="os-number">23</span><span class="os-divider">. </span>
<div class="os-problem-container"><p id="import-auto-id2677616">Convert an absolute pressure of <span class="os-math-in-para"><math display="inline"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mrow><mtext>00</mtext><mo stretchy="false">×</mo><msup><mtext>10</mtext><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup><mtext> N/m</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation-xml encoding="MathML-Content"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mrow><mtext>00</mtext><mo stretchy="false">×</mo><msup><mtext>10</mtext><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mspace width="0.25em"></mspace><msup><mtext> N/m</mtext><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="StarMath 5.0"> size 12{7 "." "00" times "10" rSup { size 8{5} } " N/m" rSup { size 8{2} } } {}</annotation></semantics></annotation-xml></semantics></math></span> to gauge pressure in <span class="os-math-in-para"><math